<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Boise Gems</title>
    <%- include("includes/head") %>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <%- include("includes/header") %>
    </header>
    <main>
        <br>
        <div style="padding: 12px">
            <div class="form-panel">
<form action="/extend-contract/<%= thisUser.id %>" method="post">
                <h1 style="text-align: center;">Extend Contract</h1>
                <br>
                <h2>Extend Contract to <b><%= thisUser.firstname %> <%= thisUser.lastname %></b></h2>
                <br>
                <p>By clicking the button below, you are extending a contract to <%= thisUser.firstname %> <%= thisUser.lastname %> for the <b><%= CURRENTSEASON %></b> season, with the section <%= thisUser.section %> and a role/instrument of <%= thisUser.instrument %>. <%= thisUser.firstname %> will have 30 days to sign the contract, requiring a down payment of $50 to ensure their commitment. If you believe this member is deserving of such an extension, please click below.</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 8px; font-style: italic;">Note: Members can be contracted with multiple groups (e.g., both Corps and Independent). Extending a new contract type will not affect existing contracts.</p>
                <br>
                <br>
                <label for="group">Group</label>
                <select name="group">
                    <option value="corps">Corps</option>
                    <option value="independent">Independent</option>
                    <option value="affiliate">Affiliate</option>
                </select>
                <br>
                <br>
                <div style="align-items: center; text-align: left;">
                    
                    <label for="bypass">Bypass down payment?</label>
                    <input type="checkbox" name="bypass" style="vertical-align: middle;"/>
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    <div style="text-align: center;">
                        <button>Extend Contract</button>
                    </div>
                
                </div>
            </form>
</div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
        <%- include("includes/footer") %>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>